{"id": "1546235801497505823", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "514145255923253272", "author_name": "milliampere_0237", "content": "There is a few! Each has their own quirks, however.\n\nPollux: he's WONDERFUL but he could be slow and you need his weapon to time right and stuff. You're also screwed if your opponent has dispellers (horla, doll, tinct, dispel debuffs weapon, etc).\nGlotan: virtually no downsides lmfao\nNymphaea+Horla: Poison hell but beware for dispellers.\nXu: Wonderful but she's slow. Beware of Clementine. Beware of fortress, barrier, etc too.\nVortice: As above.", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:09:02.749000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["389124340752580608"], "reply_to": "1546212077788467251"}
{"id": "1546241028481220729", "channel_id": "1326453691527594035", "author_id": "977411731410260028", "author_name": "siul2353", "content": "The meta is finding a character that you like then trying out combos that have synergies with them, how do you know when a team has synergy? \nYou will start winning against players and not only against bots.", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T19:29:48.959000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["389124340752580608"], "reply_to": "1546212077788467251"}
